DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
44950::$$$message_0398_0000_0000$$$::"WHAAAT!?"::
44951::$$$message_0398_0000_0001$$$::"Whoa! W-what's going on!? Are we under attack!?"::
44952::$$$message_0398_0000_0002$$$::"Look at this flyer, boy!"::
44953::$$$message_0398_0000_0003$$$::"Um, let me see... All units of [font italic=true]Admirable Tactics Side Story: Shine Noir High School White Paper[font italic=false] are already sold out in stores..."::
44954::$$$message_0398_0000_0004$$$::"...I think I'm going to regret asking, but what's the big deal?"::
44955::$$$message_0398_0000_0005$$$::"It is the biggest of deals! Tell me, boy[line len=2]why didn't you preorder this before you summoned me!?"::
44956::$$$message_0398_0000_0006$$$::"Don't be absurd! How was I supposed to know that a Servant would care about video games!?"::
44957::$$$message_0398_0000_0007$$$::"You are a mage!"::
44958::$$$message_0398_0000_0008$$$::"Even a Magician wouldn't be able to tell what you're thinking!"::
44959::$$$message_0398_0000_0009$$$::"Nnrgh... What should I do... Perhaps I'll take Gordius Wheel on a visit to the game developer..."::
44960::$$$message_0398_0000_0010$$$::(Oh god, he's actually considering it.)::
44961::$$$message_0398_0000_0011$$$::"Um, hey. I saw this next to the flyer."::
44962::$$$message_0398_0000_0012$$$::"What now?[wvl canskip=false time=100] Hmm...[wvl canskip=false time=100] 'Have you heard of the onsen that grants any wish? Visit the greatest and oldest hot spot in Fuyuki...'"::
44963::$$$message_0398_0000_0013$$$::"Wait, what!?"::
44964::$$$message_0398_0000_0014$$$::"'But only the first visiting group's wish will come true. Be prepared should you visit us.'[wvl canskip=false time=200] ...I see."::
44965::$$$message_0398_0000_0015$$$::(It sounds unbelievably shady. What is this, some Tohsaka ploy?)::
44966::$$$message_0398_0000_0016$$$::(Or maybe it's the Einzberns...)::
44967::$$$message_0398_0000_0017$$$::(We still don't have the full lay of the land in Fuyuki. If they're luring us into their territory... No no no, wait!)::
44968::$$$message_0398_0000_0018$$$::(Nobody would be stupid enough to fall for a trap like this!)::
44969::$$$message_0398_0000_0019$$$::"...Hey, what are we doing outside!?"::
44970::$$$message_0398_0000_0020$$$::"Finally noticed, did you? You were spacing out, so I threw you onto Gordius Wheel."::
44971::$$$message_0398_0000_0021$$$::"I'm asking why I'm out here with you!"::
44972::$$$message_0398_0000_0022$$$::"Isn't it obvious? We are going to visit this wish-granting onsen to change the past."::
44973::$$$message_0398_0000_0023$$$::"...Huh?"::
44974::$$$message_0398_0000_0024$$$::"We simply need to change history so that you did in fact preorder the new Admirable Tactics game!"::
44975::$$$message_0398_0000_0025$$$::"I could just buy it normally, but changing the past is more my style."::
44976::$$$message_0398_0000_0026$$$::"That's the stupidest wish I've ever heard! And you're walking into an obvious trap!"::
44977::$$$message_0398_0000_0027$$$::"Even so, let us be away, boy!"::
44978::$$$message_0398_0000_0028$$$::"Ahh ha ha! That's right, [font italic=true]this[font italic=false] guy would be stupid enough to fall for it! I wanna go home!"::

